据你骑行习惯定制的维护系统；买一盆绿植，附赠一个根据家里光照、温度定制的养护助手。\n\n2）每次协作都可能产生一个软件。 Meta 的 Muse 开始探索按需构建工具。比如几个朋友约着出去玩，行程规划、费用分摊、照片共享，直接生成一套软件。玩完了，软件也就可以退场了。\n\n过去是人去适应软件，未来可能是需要什么软件，就现场做一个。把时间再往后拨两三年，事情会越来越有趣。😄","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6af9fa0f320fd7e1b5fc0607","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-16T02:29:35+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T12:08:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","display_name":"Barret李靖","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fs-eSdFZY-o3eJCp506HPIEBqkXe?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6af96eac136b2761c67e5e83","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","source_name":"刘飞Lufy","title":"","summary":"古建探索","body":"古建探索","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6af96eac136b2761c67e5e83","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FiGhGjSUQWSB1yF0GR2uMKLNZ5tIv3.heic?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/format/jpeg/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T16:34:52+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T12:08:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","display_name":"刘飞Lufy","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FiGhGjSUQWSB1yF0GR2uMKLNZ5tIv3.heic?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/format/jpeg/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FqyTdWFtmd7FRg8h5PvBZtLIzFt_v3.heic?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/format/jpeg/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FoGHzZBq-WFWe6dFMll61vvu7vgbv3.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FhkjpA-oBGBuXx2UPVmqlglA4pPKv3.jpg"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FgT6fF6ajicCzhzz5Jmcxqhe0X5Sv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-